/T (Understanding how programs execute internally is difficult for many learners. Although concepts such as instruction execution, control flow, and memory usage are taught theoretically, the actual runtime behavior of programs is not easily visible. This project aims to create a system that can trace program execution and monitor system resources during runtime.)
